  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Your bite can deliver the ancestral occult magic that runs through you. </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">When you take this feat, you choose between <em>Charm</em>, <em>Sleep, </em>or <em>Fear</em>. You can cast your chosen spell once per day as an innate occult 1st rank spell. As part of casting this spell, you can make an unarmed Fangs Strike against a creature within its range to deliver the spell instead of casting it normally. On a successful hit, a creature makes their saving throw against the spell. A creature targeted by the Charm spell ignores the circumstance bonus for the hostile action made by you.</span></p>"
